# The assistant's model (assistant spec §8: Apache 2.0, tool calling, 4B for
# the `small` profile on CPU). Installed by the openvibes-llm package as
# /usr/share/openvibes-llm/model.pin; `openvibes-admin assistant model fetch`
# downloads it from its publisher, and the offline kit's README quotes it.
# No package carries the model. The URL names an exact Hugging Face commit,
# and the SHA-256 (the file's published LFS id, re-checked on download) pins
# its bytes. To update: pick a model, check its
# licence allows redistribution, set all values, and run
# `openvibes-admin assistant eval` against it before merging, and add the
# old LLM_MODEL_FILE to past-models (updates switch hosts over, #264).
#
# Qwen3.5-4B (Apache 2.0): Qwen publishes no GGUF of it, so this is
# unsloth's Q4_K_M of Qwen/Qwen3.5-4B, the exact file the eval passed on
# twice (2026-10-10; Qwen3-4B and Gemma-4-E4B failed the gate). The licence
# is the original model's.
LLM_MODEL_FILE=Qwen3.5-4B-Q4_K_M.gguf
LLM_MODEL_URL=https://huggingface.co/unsloth/Qwen3.5-4B-GGUF/resolve/e87f176479d0855a907a41277aca2f8ee7a09523/Qwen3.5-4B-Q4_K_M.gguf
LLM_MODEL_SHA256=00fe7986ff5f6b463e62455821146049db6f9313603938a70800d1fb69ef11a4
LLM_MODEL_ALIAS=qwen3.5-4b
LLM_MODEL_LICENSE_URL=https://huggingface.co/Qwen/Qwen3.5-4B/resolve/851bf6e806efd8d0a36b00ddf55e13ccb7b8cd0a/LICENSE
